# Echo: every call answered on time passes, the level goes up after four; with no answers, three misses and over
wait 800
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
wait 400
expect cab 3
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect game 4
shot stand.png
autoecho on
tap PLAY
wait 5000
shot call.png
wait 1200
shot answer.png
wait 20000
expect echo_state 1
expect echo_lives 3
expect echo_score >3
expect echo_pct >89
expect echo_level >1
autoecho off
wait 20000
expect echo_state 2
shot over.png
